<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Heineken.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Heineken.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch brewer Heineken NV was raised to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market underperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
